            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">This dataset is established for the manufacturing of LCD screens. Due to a lack of structured data the inventory bases on assumptions and lab-scale technology. Direct process emissions are not known and disregarded. The dataset therefore must not be used for the direct comparison of different film deposition technologies. The functional unit of this dataset is cubic meter resulting from the sputtered area times the film thickness. Film thickness depends on display technology: STN LCD: 150nm top;
Synonyms: Indium Tin Oxide, Indium Zinn Oxid, TFT, Transparent and conductive Oxide Layer, TCO, physical vapour deposition, PVD; 
UUID: b163e170-367e-34c5-9ee8-97f3839e238f</common:generalComment>
